 "statement": "The constructed morphism $X^{\\mathrm{fp}}\\to S$ is separated and of\nfinite presentation, and the constructed map\n$i^{\\mathrm{fp}}_{X/S}\\colon X\\to X^{\\mathrm{fp}}$ is a closed immersion\nover $S$.",
